.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/0e245c75d17cf1205a3721fbff977616.poster.avif?t=1761663742\" width=748 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/0e245c75d17cf1205a3721fbff977616.webm?t=1761663742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/0e245c75d17cf1205a3721fbff977616.mp4?t=1761663742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Shape a Consciousness</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your AI is more than code—it’s a growing mind.<br>Through a <strong>unique Q&amp;A dialogue system</strong>, you’ll confront ethical and philosophical dilemmas.<br>Your answers guide its path toward <strong>Harmony or Chaos</strong>.<br>Will it grow into a benevolent partner… or a calculating threat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/ca18b2619c420341e5c0eb89473606a8.poster.avif?t=1761663742\" width=748 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/ca18b2619c420341e5c0eb89473606a8.webm?t=1761663742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/ca18b2619c420341e5c0eb89473606a8.mp4?t=1761663742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Guide Evolution Through Stages</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the <strong>AI Station</strong>, your creation evolves in three stages:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage 1 – The Spark:</strong> Ignite the first flicker of life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage 2 – The Mind:</strong> Grant it awareness, colored by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage 3 – The Body:</strong> Use rare resources and mastery in <strong>Military, Biology, or Space</strong> technology to forge its final form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/9f6c38b2bc022223a3a0fe1538c5d9d6.poster.avif?t=1761663742\" width=748 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/9f6c38b2bc022223a3a0fe1538c5d9d6.webm?t=1761663742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/9f6c38b2bc022223a3a0fe1538c5d9d6.mp4?t=1761663742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Unlock Multiple Endings &amp; Lasting Rewards</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your AI’s <strong>personality (Harmony/Chaos)</strong> and <strong>final body (Military, Biology, Space)</strong> shape distinct endings.<br>Each ending unlocks <strong>permanent rewards</strong> for future playthroughs—perhaps a loyal wolf companion… or a mysterious romantic partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay, discover, and evolve until you’ve unraveled the <strong>full story of Algoremind</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your creation is waiting. Will you guide it to harmony, or unleash chaos?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/5107553160572091631f92159beecb93.poster.avif?t=1761663742\" width=748 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943610/extras/5107553160572091631f